decisions:
  - id: portable_context_router
    summary: route context depth and timing by profile, never required behaviour
  - id: capability_by_observation_not_registry
    summary: license lean context from fixture-scored behaviour, never from model identity
  - id: wiki_method_product_axis
    summary: every wiki page declares axis method or product, matching its directory
  - id: yaml_skill_frontmatter_deviation
    summary: keep skill frontmatter in YAML despite the TOON default for state
  - id: static_analysis_from_specialise
    summary: every generated project makes an explicit static-analysis decision at /specialise
  - id: nix_first_build_pipeline
    summary: every generated project makes an explicit build decision at /specialise; Nix owns the toolchain
  - id: deployment_pipeline_from_specialise
    summary: every generated project records a deployment pipeline decision at /specialise
  - id: observability_from_specialise
    summary: every generated project records an observability decision at /specialise

risks:
  - skill proliferation: 4 new skills added; each is lean but catalog is growing
  - tool deprecation: per-runtime tool suggestions may go stale; mitigated by revisit_trigger
  - pre-existing D1/D2/D4/D8/D9 warnings remain from the Phase 1 dedupe ledger
  - no real generated project has exercised this yet; adoption friction may surface
  - the apply_diff tool intermittently failed with missing path parameter; retried successfully each time

